{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":17,"ref":"2-chronicles 29:17","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"tw","chapter":29,"translation":"Wɔhyɛɛ aseɛ wɔ da a ɛdi kan a ɔsram a ɛdi kan no mu de kɔɔ so; na wɔda awotwe so wɔ ɔsram no mu no, wɔbaa Yawe ehyia mu ase, na wɔkɔɔ so wiee ⟨את⟩ Yawe fie dɔnhwere awotwe mu; wɔda dunsia so wɔ ɔsram a ɛdi kan no mu no, wɔwiee.","tokens":[{"surface":"ויחלו","gloss":"wɔhyɛɛ aseɛ"},{"surface":"באחד","gloss":"wɔ da a ɛdi kan"},{"surface":"לחדש","gloss":"ɔsram no mu"},{"surface":"הראשון","gloss":"a ɛdi kan"},{"surface":"לקדש","gloss":"de kɔɔ so"},{"surface":"וביום","gloss":"na wɔda ... so"},{"surface":"שמונה","gloss":"awotwe"},{"surface":"לחדש","gloss":"ɔsram no mu"},{"surface":"באו","gloss":"wɔbaa"},{"surface":"לאולם","gloss":"ehyia mu ase"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"Yawe"},{"surface":"ויקדשו","gloss":"wɔkɔɔ so wiee"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"Yawe fie"},{"surface":"בית","gloss":"fie"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"Yawe"},{"surface":"לימים","gloss":"dɔnhwere ... mu"},{"surface":"שמונה","gloss":"awotwe"},{"surface":"וביום","gloss":"wɔda ... so"},{"surface":"ששה","gloss":"dunsia"},{"surface":"עשר","gloss":"(dunsia = sixteen)"},{"surface":"לחדש","gloss":"ɔsram no mu"},{"surface":"הראשון","gloss":"a ɛdi kan"},{"surface":"כלו","gloss":"wɔwiee"}],"timestamp":"2026-09-16T05:07:57.193578418Z","model":"glm-5.3"}